<title>THAILAND: Nakornthon Bank H1 net up slighlty.</title>
<headline>Nakornthon Bank H1 net up slighlty.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the six months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.60     vs	    2.57</p>
<p>    Net			313.50     vs	  280.53</p>
<p>Notes: Second quarter figures unavailable. Total assets through June 30 totalled 59.32 billion baht vs 51.38 billion baht. Deposits for the period totalled 41.83 billion baht vs 33.96 billion baht the same period last year. Loans after bad debts totalled 49.84 billion baht vs 42.85 billion baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950</p>
</text>
